{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, take it, check properties, do task. If path clear, move. Finally, scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = DoTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Condition ID = IsPathClear    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
